## Enabling providers

tessera.config.ts

```
export default defineConfig({
  auth: {
    providers: {
      email: { magicLink: true },
      github: { clientId: env("GITHUB_ID"), clientSecret: env("GITHUB_SECRET") },
      google: { clientId: env("GOOGLE_ID"), clientSecret: env("GOOGLE_SECRET") },
    },
  },
})
```

## Signing in

TypeScript

```
await auth.signIn("github", { redirectTo: "/dashboard" })

const user = await auth.user()
// user: { id, email, name } | null
```

## OAuth

Set the callback URL in your provider’s console to `https://<project>.tessera.dev/auth/callback`. Preview branches get their own callback automatically.

Linking accounts

Users who sign in with two providers using the same verified email are linked to one account.

